Partner

## Want to collab?

FRCTL is built with the people who use it. If you have an audience, a lineup, a product, or an idea, hit us up!

- 01AffiliatesShare with your audience, earn sub credits.
- 02AmbassadorsRun FRCTL in your sets, get early access to new features.
- 03ArtistsSell VJ loops on a founding artist rate.
- 04EventsFestivals, venues, labels, agencies. Stage visuals and workshops.
- 05BrandsIntegrations, hardware, designs.

